1. e4 g6 2. d4 d6 3. Nc3 Bg7 4. Be3 Nf6 5. Qd2 Ng4 6. Bg5 h6 7. Bh4 g5 8. Bg3
e5 9. dxe5 Nxe5 10. h4 Be6 11. O-O-O Nbd7 12. hxg5 hxg5 13. Rxh8+ Bxh8 14. Nh3
Bxh3 15. gxh3 Nb6 16. Bb5+ Kf8 17. Be2 Qf6 18. Nd5 Nxd5 19. Qxd5 Rb8 20. c3 a6
21. Qd4 $2 {White persists in looking for a non-existent edge. Soon enough he
is worse.} Qe6 $1 22. Qa7 $2 {What??} Nc6 23. Qe3 Qxa2 24. Qxg5 $6 Qa1+ 25. Kc2
Nb4+ $1 {Ouch. Humble pie must be eaten.} 26. Kd2 (26. cxb4 Qxb2+ 27. Kd3 Qc3#)
26... Qxb2+ 27. Ke1 Qxc3+ 28. Kf1 Qf6 $2 {Anxious to consolidate, Black makes
a typical error.} (28... Nc6) (28... Be5) 29. Qa5 Qc3 30. Rxd6 cxd6 31. Bxd6+
Ke8 32. Qg5 $5 Nc6 33. Qg8+ Kd7 34. Bxb8 {Short of time, Black forgets to
"keep it simple".} Qa1+ $2 (34... Nxb8 35. Qxb8 Qxh3+ 36. Kg1 Kc6 $11) 35. Kg2
Qg7+ 36. Bg4+ $1 {Counter check!} Ke7 37. Qc8 Nxb8 38. Qxb7+ Kf6 39. Qxb8 Kg5 {
Wow.} (39... Qg5 40. Qg3 Qe5 41. f4 {1-0 is the finish as (incorrectly) given
on 2022 CB Mega Database.}) 40. Qg3 Qe5 $4 41. f4+ {Hmmm.} 1-0

